<section class="lp-faq" id="faq">
    <div class="lp-faq-inner">
        <p class="lp-section-eyebrow">FAQ</p>
        <h2 class="lp-section-title">Answers to the questions HR teams actually ask.</h2>
        <div class="lp-faq-list">
            <details class="lp-faq-item">
                <summary>Is Ukuu HR specific to the Zambian tax system?</summary>
                <div class="lp-faq-answer">
                    Ukuu HR ships with built-in country configurations for Zambia (ZRA 2025 PAYE brackets, NAPSA), Tanzania (PAYE, NSSF), and Malawi (PAYE, NHIMA). Switching organization country automatically loads the right statutory config &mdash; same UI, different compliance rules.
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="lp-faq-item">
                <summary>Can I import my existing employee list?</summary>
                <div class="lp-faq-answer">
                    Yes &mdash; CSV and XLSX import are built in. The 4-step onboarding wizard (Personal &rarr; Employment &rarr; Banking &rarr; Tax &amp; Statutory) mirrors the import columns, so you can round-trip data without losing fidelity.
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="lp-faq-item">
                <summary>Does it work with our attendance device?</summary>
                <div class="lp-faq-answer">
                    Hikvision (ISAPI), ZKTeco, Suprema, Dahua, Anviz, Matrix, and eSSL are all supported via REST + CSV. The desktop sync app bridges LAN-only devices. New vendor connectors can be added in &lt; 200 lines via the IDeviceConnector interface.
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="lp-faq-item">
                <summary>What if I don't have a Postgres database?</summary>
                <div class="lp-faq-answer">
                    Ukuu HR falls back to SQLite automatically &mdash; fine for trials and small teams. For production with multiple concurrent users, set <code>POSTGRES_CONNECTION_STRING</code> and the app will use Postgres without any code changes.
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="lp-faq-item">
                <summary>Can I run it on my own infrastructure?</summary>
                <div class="lp-faq-answer">
                    Yes. The Docker image is published at <code>ghcr.io/stackone-tec/ukuu-hr-csharp:latest</code> (multi-arch: linux/amd64 + linux/arm64). Deploy to Fly.io, Render, AWS ECS, Azure Container Apps, or any Docker host. Or run from source with the .NET 10 SDK.
                </div>
            </details>
            <details class="lp-faq-item">
                <summary>Is my data encrypted?</summary>
                <div class="lp-faq-answer">
                    Bank account numbers, NRCs, and TPINs are AES-256 encrypted at rest with a key from <code>UKUU_ENCRYPTION_KEY</code> (or a key file fallback). The encryption service never crashes on a missing key &mdash; it generates a process-stable one so your app keeps running during migrations.
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

